# Pairs with WorkspaceNonDisclosure. A caller bound to no grant of the app must be answered as for an app that
# does not exist, so the tree must not be resolved before the caller's grant membership is checked.
MODULE: AppsBridgeResolvesTreeBeforeGrant
TARGET: WorkspaceNonDisclosure
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the bridge resolves the tree before checking the caller holds any grant of the app
PERTURBS: BridgeAuthorize

--- FIND
               ELSE IF ~member THEN "denied"
               ELSE IF t \notin DeclaredTrees THEN "notFound"
--- REPLACE
               ELSE IF t \notin DeclaredTrees THEN "notFound"
               ELSE IF ~member THEN "denied"
--- END
